{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647870/extras/Gimme.gif?t=1748788534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infiltrate, loot, cast, and escape in this fast turn-based magical heist roguelike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a cunning wizard-thief breaking into a small warehouse to steal valuable gems. Though abandoned, the warehouse\u2019s security robots remain active and are eager to eliminate any intruders. Use your magical powers to outsmart the robots, collect as much treasure as you can, and escape before you\u2019re taken down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging turn-based tactical gameplay</strong> focused on enemy parity, clever positioning and board manipulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse spells</strong> that let you dash great distances, swap places with objects, phase through obstacles, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple controls</strong>\u2014just directional input and two buttons, making it easy to pick up and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No inventory management or excessive menuing</strong>\u2014just straight forward action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced</strong>\u00a0with rapid-fire turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coffee-break friendly runs</strong>\u2014each one takes just about 10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 different game modes</strong>, offering plenty of variety and challenge.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647870?t=1748788534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647870/c567ff6e6f5222abb7ec54ba6cd011af33