.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No inventory management or excessive menuing</strong>\u2014just straight forward action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced</strong>\u00a0with rapid-fire turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coffee-break friendly runs</strong>\u2014each one takes just about 10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 different game modes</strong>, offering plenty of variety and challenge.</p></li></ul>","developers":["11clock"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647870/0dcb530c9393647e1a539d76c87e2beaa27d4dae/header.jpg?t=1748788534","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137419,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137419/movie480.mp4?t=1747086958","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137419/movie_max.mp4?t=1747086958"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137419/ec8392684c59f84965ff1947b90b4a37021ca84e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747086958","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137419/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747086958","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137419/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747086958"}}],"name":"ByteRogue","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8